H9XASH xash.dll -- built from patched source by TSM\xash3d-h9-patches\xash.bat

The engine. The webassembly patch's engine part (emscripten code, compiled out on Windows), engine-h9-cloak.patch (a server-side cloak on your own model), engine-h9-cmdbuf.patch (a command buffer that holds H9's configs), engine-h9-chatmouse.patch (mouse-look while typing in chat) and engine-h9-suddendeath.patch (sudden-death fog read from the h9_fog_* server cvars into movevars).

Upstream: FWGS master e8d773ea. Built: branch h9 at 7129989e. Below is the whole
source change, paths from the xash3d-fwgs root; "git apply" replays it on a clone.

